    <string name="help_title">Not seeing your TV?</string>
    <string name="help_body">• Check that debugging is on (step 3).\n• Make sure both are on the same Wi-Fi.\n• Some routers hide devices from each other: type the TV’s address instead.</string>
    <string name="manual_title">Or type its address</string>
    <string name="manual_body">On the TV: Settings › Network › your Wi-Fi. For Wireless debugging, add the port it shows, like 192.168.1.50:41234.</string>
    <string name="manual_hint">192.168.1.50</string>
    <string name="connect">Connect</string>
